Create an Employee class with:

employeeId
employeeName
department
salary

Requirements:

Use only TreeSet.
Employees should be sorted by salary in descending order.
employeeId should be unique.
If two employees have the same salary but different IDs, both should be stored.
If two employees have the same ID, they should be treated as duplicates, even if their salaries are different.
Use Comparable<Employee>.
Do not use HashSet, HashMap, or Comparator.